@model IndexModel
@{
    var zh = Model.IsChinese;
}
<header class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">@(zh ? "日常祈禱" : "WORDS TO RETURN TO")</span><h1>@(zh ? "祈禱文庫" : "The prayer library")</h1><p>@(zh ? "無論身處人生哪個時刻，總有祈禱詞與你同行。" : "Find a prayer for wherever you are in your journey.")</p></div><span class="heading-mark">✳</span></header>
<div class="prayer-list">
    <details class="prayer-entry" open><summary><span class="prayer-number">01</span><span><span class="eyebrow">@(zh ? "傳統 · 1 分鐘" : "TRADITIONAL · 1 MIN")</span><strong>@(zh ? "天主經" : "Our Father")</strong><small>@(zh ? "耶穌親自教導門徒的祈禱。" : "The prayer Jesus taught his disciples.")</small></span><span class="entry-plus">＋</span></summary><div class="prayer-text"><p>@(zh ? "在天我等父者，我等願爾名見聖。爾國臨格。爾旨承行於地，如於天焉。我等望爾，今日與我，我日用糧。而免我債，如我亦免負我債者。又不我許陷於誘惑。乃救我於凶惡。亞孟。" : "Our Father, who art in heaven, hallowed be thy name. Thy kingdom come, thy will be done, on earth as it is in heaven. Give us this day our daily bread, and forgive us our trespasses, as we forgive those who trespass against us. And lead us not into temptation, but deliver us from evil. Amen.")</p><p class="latin-prayer">Pater noster, qui es in cælis: sanctificetur nomen tuum; adveniat regnum tuum; fiat voluntas tua, sicut in cælo et in terra. Panem nostrum quotidianum da nobis hodie; et dimitte nobis debita nostra, sicut et nos dimittimus debitoribus nostris; et ne nos inducas in tentationem; sed libera nos a malo. Amen.</p></div></details>
    <details class="prayer-entry"><summary><span class="prayer-number">02</span><span><span class="eyebrow">@(zh ? "聖母 · 1 分鐘" : "MARIAN · 1 MIN")</span><strong>@(zh ? "聖母經" : "Hail Mary")</strong><small>@(zh ? "求聖母與我們一同祈禱，並為我們轉求。" : "Ask Mary to pray with us and for us.")</small></span><span class="entry-plus">＋</span></summary><div class="prayer-text"><p>@(zh ? "萬福瑪利亞，滿被聖寵者，主與爾偕焉；女中爾為讚美，爾胎子耶穌並為讚美。天主聖母瑪利亞，為我等罪人，今祈天主，及我等死候。亞孟。" : "Hail Mary, full of grace, the Lord is with thee. Blessed art thou among women, and blessed is the fruit of thy womb, Jesus. Holy Mary, Mother of God, pray for us sinners, now and at the hour of our death. Amen.")</p><p class="latin-prayer">Ave Maria, gratia plena, Dominus tecum. Benedicta tu in mulieribus, et benedictus fructus ventris tui, Iesus. Sancta Maria, Mater Dei, ora pro nobis peccatoribus, nunc et in hora mortis nostrae. Amen.</p></div></details>
    <details class="prayer-entry"><summary><span class="prayer-number">03</span><span><span class="eyebrow">@(zh ? "傳統 · 1 分鐘" : "TRADITIONAL · 1 MIN")</span><strong>@(zh ? "聖三光榮經" : "Glory Be")</strong><small>@(zh ? "讚美天主聖三的簡短頌禱。" : "A short doxology of praise to the Holy Trinity.")</small></span><span class="entry-plus">＋</span></summary><div class="prayer-text"><p>@(zh ? "欽頌榮福，天主聖父、及聖子、及聖神，吾願其獲光榮。厥初如何，今茲亦然，以迨永遠及世之世。亞孟。" : "Glory be to the Father, and to the Son, and to the Holy Spirit. As it was in the beginning, is now, and ever shall be, world without end. Amen.")</p><p class="latin-prayer">Gloria Patri, et Filio, et Spiritui Sancto. Sicut erat in principio, et nunc, et semper, et in sæcula sæculorum. Amen.</p></div></details>
    <details class="prayer-entry"><summary><span class="prayer-number">04</span><span><span class="eyebrow">@(zh ? "望德與平安 · 2 分鐘" : "HOPE & PEACE · 2 MIN")</span><strong>@(zh ? "求平安經" : "Prayer for Peace")</strong><small>@(zh ? "為心靈及世界和平祈禱的片刻。" : "A moment to pray for peace in our hearts and in the world.")</small></span><span class="entry-plus">＋</span></summary><div class="prayer-text"><p>@(zh ? "和平之王，求你平息我內心的不安。求你賜勇氣予致力修和的人，安慰身處衝突中的人，並賜智慧予肩負艱難抉擇的人。求你使我成為耐心的聆聽者，並成為你和平的小小工具。亞孟。" : "Prince of Peace, quiet what is restless within me. Give courage to those who work for reconciliation, comfort to those living through conflict, and wisdom to those entrusted with difficult choices. Make me a patient listener and a small instrument of your peace. Amen.")</p></div></details>
    <details class="prayer-entry"><summary><span class="prayer-number">05</span><span><span class="eyebrow">@(zh ? "每日 · 2 分鐘" : "DAILY · 2 MIN")</span><strong>@(zh ? "早禱奉獻" : "Morning Offering")</strong><small>@(zh ? "將一天的喜樂與挑戰奉獻給天主。" : "Offer the joys and challenges of the day to God.")</small></span><span class="entry-plus">＋</span></summary><div class="prayer-text"><p>@(zh ? "新一天的天主，我將今天的思想、言語、工作及相遇奉獻給你。求你祝福美善的事，引領未明之事，並助我以忍耐和愛心對待每一個人。願我所做的一切使我更親近你。亞孟。" : "God of this new morning, I offer you the thoughts, words, work, and encounters of this day. Bless what is good, guide what is uncertain, and help me meet each person with patience and love. May all I do draw me closer to you. Amen.")</p></div></details>
</div>
